01:11:38.700 --> 01:11:43.700
It helps us time fundamentally driven
ideas.

01:11:43.700 --> 01:11:48.700
Fundamentals give us our bias on an asset,
so a stock.

01:11:48.700 --> 01:11:57.700
Fundamentals give us our bias, long or
short, and it gives us a potential trade
idea with edge.

01:11:57.700 --> 01:12:04.700
So, technical analysis and price action
indicators help us in timing the trade.

01:12:04.700 --> 01:12:06.700
That's all they do, guys, okay?

01:12:06.700 --> 01:12:08.700
So, don't put too much weight on it.

01:12:08.700 --> 01:12:11.700
It does not generate a trade idea.

01:12:11.700 --> 01:12:19.700
Now, if we believe at this stage that we
