01:12:19.700 --> 01:12:21.700
We've got our timing.

01:12:21.700 --> 01:12:24.700
Things are starting to look good for our
trade idea.

01:12:24.700 --> 01:12:27.700
We move on to trade structuring.

01:12:27.700 --> 01:12:31.700
Trade structuring is done around
catalysts, okay?

01:12:31.700 --> 01:12:39.700
Time horizon and volatility are the two
main constricting parameters in trading.

01:12:39.700 --> 01:12:44.700
We, as longshore portfolio managers, are
operating in the one to three month time
horizon.

01:12:44.700 --> 01:12:49.700
And we're placing ourselves in that
volatility sweet spot that we covered
earlier.

01:12:49.700 --> 01:13:04.700
In the IPLT video series, viewers watching
