01:14:08.700 --> 01:14:15.700
One of the biggest mistakes of retail
traders in the stock market is to think in
the following terms.

01:14:15.700 --> 01:14:28.700
When you're looking in the stock market,
retail traders think that a good company
automatically equals a good stock and that
automatically equals a good trade idea.

01:14:28.700 --> 01:14:33.700
That is a very bad habit and a very bad
way of thinking, okay?

01:14:33.700 --> 01:14:35.700
It's just completely wrong.

01:14:35.700 --> 01:14:39.700
What usually ends up happening in these
situations?

01:14:39.700 --> 01:14:48.700
Well, the stock ends up not even moving
within what can be defined as a trading
time horizon.

01:14:48.700 --> 01:14:52.700
And then it ends up becoming an
investment, okay?

01:14:52.700 --> 01:14:55.700
We do not operate with this mindset.

01:14:55.700 --> 01:14:58.700
We want to make money in the 20 to 60 day
time horizon.

01:14:58.700 --> 01:15:06.700
We require catalysts and we require trade
structures that optimize those catalysts
within the time horizon.

01:15:06.700 --> 01:15:11.700
This is what constitutes a genuine trade
idea.

01:15:11.700 --> 01:15:16.700
A good company does not necessarily equal
a good stock for a trader.

01:15:16.700 --> 01:15:21.700
And it does not necessarily equal a good
trade idea.

01:15:21.700 --> 01:15:23.700
It's just the wrong way to look at things,
guys.

01:15:23.700 --> 01:15:27.700
But retail traders fall into this trap
time and time again.

01:15:27.700 --> 01:15:37.700
So again, guys, just to hammer it home
because we need to iron out all of these
bad practices of retail traders, okay?

01:15:37.700 --> 01:15:41.700
In the framework, you have to understand
we are not investors.

01:15:41.700 --> 01:15:42.700
We are traders.

01:15:42.700 --> 01:15:52.700
We do not take positions in stocks and
then sit around waiting for years to find
out if we're going to be right or wrong,
okay?

01:15:52.700 --> 01:15:57.700
We require, we need catalysts.

01:15:57.700 --> 01:16:05.700
And from those catalysts, we build trade
structures that optimize the payoff within
the one to three month time horizon.

01:16:05.700 --> 01:16:15.700
The trade structure that we choose has to
reflect the fundamentals, the timing and
the catalysts that we see occurring in the
next one to three months.

