01:37:17.700 --> 01:37:22.700
So you need to also apply a maximum, okay?

01:37:22.700 --> 01:37:26.700
When you're starting out, there's a
minimum and a maximum.

01:37:26.700 --> 01:37:30.700
The minimum is obvious why you have it.

01:37:30.700 --> 01:37:38.700
Because if you're going to build a
